[break] a-run-stop-tells-later-calls-what-the-policys-stop-does
rule: After a call's run stopped the turn, a later call gets the denial the policy gives every call of a stopped turn, as it did before the round honoured the mark.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::finished
find: self.stop_at(index, reason, true);
replace: self.stop_at(index, reason, false);
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it run_stops::a_run_that_stops_the_turn_keeps_the_calls_after_it_from_running

[break] the-run-stop-keeps-later-calls-running
rule: After a call's run stopped the turn, a call the model wrote after it that is waiting to run does not run.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::stop_at
find: if matches!(self.calls[other].state, CallState::Ready(_))
replace: if matches!(self.calls[other].state, CallState::Pending)
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it run_stops::a_run_that_changes_nothing_and_stops_the_turn_keeps_a_waiting_call_from_running
    cineris-agent::it denials::a_stop_as_the_answer_to_a_question_ends_the_turn_denied

[break] the-output-policy-drops-the-mark
rule: The output policy keeps a result's stop mark.
file: crates/cineris-tools/src/result.rs
in: ToolResult::bounded_with
find: self.artifacts.extend(artifact);
replace: self.artifacts.extend(artifact); self.turn_stop = None;
packages: cineris-tools,cineris-agent
caught-by:
    cineris-tools result::tests::a_stop_mark_is_kept_by_what_adds_to_a_result
    cineris-agent::it run_stops::a_run_that_stops_the_turn_as_the_last_call_ends_it_without_asking_the_model_again

[break] a-part-added-drops-the-mark
rule: Adding a part to a result keeps its stop mark.
file: crates/cineris-tools/src/result.rs
in: ToolResult::with_part
find: self.content.push(part);
replace: self.content.push(part); self.turn_stop = None;
caught-by:
    cineris-tools result::tests::a_stop_mark_is_kept_by_what_adds_to_a_result

[break] the-shells-protected-path-stop-is-not-marked
rule: A confined command that changed protected paths marks its result as the stop, so its turn ends at it.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/checkpoints.rs
in: RecordingShell::run_by
find: result = result.stopping_turn(note);
occurrence: 1
replace: let _ = &note;
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it sandbox::sys_a_protected_path_a_command_changes_stops_the_turn_and_undo_puts_it_back
    cineris-core::it adversary::sys_an_adversarial_command_reaches_only_what_it_may

[break] the-shells-change-from-outside-is-not-marked
rule: A command refused because a protected path changed from outside since the last look marks its result as the stop.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/checkpoints.rs
in: RecordingShell::continuity
find: .stopping_turn(note)
replace: .with_payload(Json::String(note))
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it sandbox::sys_a_change_between_two_commands_is_found_and_stops_the_turn

[break] an-extensions-stopped-call-is-not-marked
rule: An extension's call that a host call's stop ended marks its result as the stop.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/ext/tools.rs
in: LoadedExtension::call_tool
find: .stopping_turn(reason)
replace: .with_payload(serde_json::Value::String(reason))
packages: cineris-core,cineris-cli
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it extensions::a_host_call_nobody_can_answer_as_the_last_call_ends_the_turn_without_asking_again
    cineris-cli::system runs::sys_exit_6_when_an_extensions_host_call_stops_the_last_call_under_fail_on_denial
